/T (As a government reaction, they should start doing an active monitoring on the poultry farms, bird markets, and slaughterhouses. Additionally, doing mandatory reporting toward farm owners, veterinarians, and the public about the dead or sick birds to stop the disease from spreading furthermore. The government should also provide financial support and additional compensation to farmers for stock losses and rapid response to ensure cooperation. )
/E (As a government reaction, they should start doing an active monitoring on the poultry farms, bird markets, and slaughterhouses. Additionally, doing mandatory reporting toward farm owners, veterinarians, and the public about the dead or sick birds to stop the disease from spreading furthermore. The government should also provide financial support and additional compensation to farmers for stock losses and rapid response to ensure cooperation. )
